## Decision

S06-003 completes construction and review of one bounded GTOC-6 per-defect terminalization verifier. It freezes one three-defect, six-subclaim carrier, binds the exact S06-002 independent verification artifact, derives every local terminal from typed evidence, conserves every survivor in a two-entry residual ledger, and computes one permutation-invariant aggregate terminal.

The S14-005/GTOC-5 construction receipt is absent at the frozen base. The verifier does not infer or fabricate it. It records `residual:s06-003:gtoc5-construction-receipt-absent` as `OpenObstruction` with survivor route `ProofObligation`. The existing S06-002 unissued-lift residual is separately carried forward. Because the bounded carrier also contains exact repairs, the legal aggregate is `StabilizedSurvivor`; both survivors remain independently visible.

Completion means the bounded packet, producer receipt, independent verification, hostile tests, and documentation reconciliation are complete. Under the epic's construction-before-activation rule, it does not mean GTOC-5 is complete, a predecessor was human-promoted, a gate is active, authority was constructed, or unrestricted GTOC-6 is established.

